<title>AUSTRIA: Austrian Air 1996 passenger volumes up 7.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Austrian Air 1996 passenger volumes up 7.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian Airlines said on Wednesday the total number of passengers rose 7.6 percent to reach a record 3.52 million last year.</p>
<p>Freight volumes rose two percent to almost 63,000 tons, the flag-carrier added in a statement, which did not contain any information on the group's financial performance.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
</text>
